      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\u2022Describes the conversion of a gastric band into an intraperitoneal chemotherapy port\u2022Removal of band is important for cytoreduction and preventing future complications.\u2022Conversion of the gastric band to an IP port saved the patient the need for a new intraperitoneal port.\u2022Rising obesity may see more patients with ovarian cancer involving gastric bands.\u2022Consider ovarian pathology in women with abdominal symptoms after bariatric surgery."},
